विष्टभ्याहमिदं कृत्स्नमेकांशेन स्थितो जगत् ॥ ४२ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":3117,\"bb\":2754,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/10/42/b2754/\",\"body_value\":\"atha vā bahunaitena
kiṁ jñātena tavārjuna
viṣṭabhyāham idaṁ kṛtsnam
ekāṁśena sthito jagat\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":3118,\"bb\":2755,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/10/42/b2755/\",\"shadow_value\":\"atha vā – or; bahunā – many; etena – by this kind; kim – what; jñātena – by knowing; tava – your; arjuna – O Arjuna; viṣṭabhya – pervading; aham – I; idam – this; kṛtsnam – entire; eka – by one; aṁśena – part; sthitaḥ – am situated; jagat – universe.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"atha vā\",\"translation\":\"or\"},{\"word\":\"bahunā\",\"translation\":\"many\"},{\"word\":\"etena\",\"translation\":\"by this kind\"},{\"word\":\"kim\",\"translation\":\"what\"},{\"word\":\"jñātena\",\"translation\":\"by knowing\"},{\"word\":\"tava\",\"translation\":\"your\"},{\"word\":\"arjuna\",\"translation\":\"O Arjuna\"},{\"word\":\"viṣṭabhya\",\"translation\":\"pervading\"},{\"word\":\"aham\",\"translation\":\"I\"},{\"word\":\"idam\",\"translation\":\"this\"},{\"word\":\"kṛtsnam\",\"translation\":\"entire\"},{\"word\":\"eka\",\"translation\":\"by one\"},{\"word\":\"aṁśena\",\"translation\":\"part\"},{\"word\":\"sthitaḥ\",\"translation\":\"am situated\"},{\"word\":\"jagat\",\"translation\":\"universe\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":3119,\"bb\":2756,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/10/42/b2756/\",\"body_value\":\"But what need is there, Arjuna, for all this detailed knowledge? With a single fragment of Myself I pervade and support this entire universe.\"}]},{\"section\":\"purport\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.purport\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":3120,\"bb\":2757,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/10/42/b2757/\",\"body_value\":\"The Supreme Lord is represented throughout the entire material universes by His entering into all things as the Supersoul. The Lord here tells Arjuna that there is no point in understanding how things exist in their separate opulence and grandeur. He should know that all things are existing due to Kṛṣṇa’s entering them as Supersoul. From Brahmā, the most gigantic entity, on down to the smallest ant, all are existing because the Lord has entered each and all and is sustaining them.\"},{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":3121,\"bb\":2758,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/10/42/b2758/\",\"body_value\":\"$25\"},{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":3122,\"bb\":2759,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/10/42/b2759/\",\"body_value\":\"yac-chakti-leśāt sūryādyā
bhavanty aty-ugra-tejasaḥ
yad-aṁśena dhṛtaṁ viśvaṁ
sa kṛṣṇo daśame ’rcyate\"},{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":3123,\"bb\":2760,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/10/42/b2760/\",\"body_value\":\"From Lord Kṛṣṇa’s potent energy even the powerful sun gets its power, and by Kṛṣṇa’s partial expansion the whole world is maintained. Therefore Lord Śrī Kṛṣṇa is worshipable.\"},{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph_end\",\"id\":3124,\"bb\":2761,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/10/42/b2761/\",\"body_value\":\"Thus end the Bhaktivedanta Purports to the Tenth Chapter of the Śrīmad Bhagavad-gītā in the matter of the Opulence of the Absolute.\"}]}],\"short_title\":\"Bg. 10.42\",\"medium_title\":\"Bhagavad-gītā As It Is 10.42\"},\"locale\":\"en\",\"activeView\":\"$6:props:activeView\"}]}],\"$L26\",\"$L27\",\"$L28\"]}]\n"])self.__next_f.push([1,"2a:I[83068,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0.zxv9arc6a56.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00-zmo-3n1bt8.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0p4z5tusn0jt6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/01mcazkjru_is.js\"],\"default\"]\n30:I[78455,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0.zxv9arc6a56.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00-zmo-3n1bt8.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0p4z5tusn0jt6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/01mcazkjru_is.js\"],\"default\"]\n26:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"px-4 py-4 w-full max-w-screen-xl mx-auto md:px-8 mb-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"nav\",null,{\"aria-label\":\"Breadcrumb\",\"className\":\"breadcrumb mb-8 text-base\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"ol\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"/en/library/\",{\"className\":\"inline\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L20\",null,{\"href\":\"/en/librar