त्वत्त: कमलपत्राक्ष माहात्म्यमपि चाव्ययम् ॥ २ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":3135,\"bb\":2771,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/11/2/b2771/\",\"body_value\":\"bhavāpyayau hi bhūtānāṁ
